  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<i>Game created as a bachelor thesis on \"Design of a game utilizing the
    3D generative tools\". All the game assets used, such as parts of the source
    code, 3D models, textures, sounds, music and translations were all created using
    generative artificial intelligence with a few exceptions.</i>\n\n<b>List of AI
    tools used:</b>\nHunyuan 3D 2.0 (Local) - 3D Models\nFLUX.1 [dev] (Local) - Textures\nOllama,
    various models (Local) - Code snippets/Ideas\nCSM.ai - 3D Models\nElevenLabs
    - Sound Effects\nSuno - Music\n\n<b>Thank you sincerely for playing,</b>\nLuk\xE1\u0161
    Urban - Author of the project\n<u>https://www.urban-lukas.cz/</u>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5c94aa2ea24507149945cea823f95370, type: 2}
